42	  </div>
43	
44	  <div class="section">
45	    <h2>2. Cultural Context</h2>
46	    <h3>Philippi in the 1st Century</h3>
47	    <ul>
48	      <li><strong>Roman Colony:</strong> Philippi was a Roman colony with Roman citizens, voting rights, and Latin as the official language</li>
49	      <li><strong>Strategic City:</strong> Major trade route, gold mining center, key military outpost</li>
50	      <li><strong>Jewish Minority:</strong> Small Jewish population, no synagogue—prayer meetings by the river</li>
51	      <li><strong>Paul's Visit:</strong> Paul's Second Missionary Journey (~50 AD), he visited on a vision (Acts 16:9)</li>
52	    </ul>
53	    
